<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><documents xmlns:xsi = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation = "HDocumentSchema.xsd"><document type = "H"><pnldref>H1280</pnldref><english><title>Fail to notify the disposal of a shotgun outside Great Britain</title><additionalkeywords><additionalkeyword>34</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>36</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>FIREARMS AMENDMENT ACT 1997</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>GB</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>CERTIFICATE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>PURCHASE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ACQUIRE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ACQUISITION</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>NOTICE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>PURCHASED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>PURCHASING</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>AUTHORISE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>AUTHORISED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>AUTHORISATION</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>CHIEF OFFICER OF POLICE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>DISPOSE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>DISPOSED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>FAILED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>FAILURE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>NOTIFICATION</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>NOTIFY</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>NOTIFIED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>FAILING</additionalkeyword></additionalkeywords><standardoffencewording>On **(..SPECIFY DATE..) at **(..SPECIFY TOWNSHIP..) being the holder of a shotgun certificate which authorised the purchase or acquisition of **(..SPECIFY SHOTGUN..) and having disposed of that shotgun outside Great Britain, failed to comply with section 35(1) of the Firearms (Amendment) Act 1997 in that you did not, within 14 days of the disposal, give notice of it, by registered post or recorded delivery service or similar outside the United Kingdom, to the Chief Officer of Police for **(..SPECIFY THE POLICE FORCE..) who had granted your certificate.</standardoffencewording><legislation>Contrary to sections 35(2) and 36(b) of the Firearms (Amendment) Act 1997.</legislation><pointstoprove>date and location&lt;br /&gt; shotgun certificate holder&lt;br /&gt; authorised purchase / acquisition of shotgun&lt;br /&gt; dispose of outside Great Britain&lt;br /&gt; fail comply with section 35(1) in that&lt;br /&gt; did not send notice of disposal within 14 days &lt;br /&gt; to chief officer of police</pointstoprove><investigatoractions><investigatoraction><code>IA1</code><description>Fingerprint and photograph</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA2</code><description>DNA Samples: If crime scene stain present - take evidential sample If no crime scene stain and DNA not confirmed on PNC - take Criminal Justice sample. If DNA confirmed on PNC - CJ sample not required</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA27</code><description>Confirm proposed charge is appropriately authorised (Police or CPS)</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA28</code><description>Ensure compliance with investigator's obligations re disclosure</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA29</code><description>Consider if case suitable for referral to Financial Investigation Unit and CPS for asset recovery eg confiscation order</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA4</code><description>PNC recordable</description></investigatoraction></investigatoractions><policeandcpschargingresponsibilities>D27968</policeandcpschargingresponsibilities><notes>See also offence wording: H4425 re failure to properly notify firearm transaction in other EC  state.</notes></english><indictment><indictmentindicator><code>N</code><description>No</description></indictmentindicator><structuredindictmentindicator><code>N</code><description>No</description></structuredindictmentindicator></indictment><other><powersofarrest>Arrest without warrant</po